y.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ levels of increasing complexity as you balance to navigate through the grid with ever changing controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense single-player, co-op, and battle modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach high ranks in each sector to unlock new ships</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energetic and frantic soundtrack to match your scrambling thoughts</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nerdy Birdy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903010/2169699295679197b7312b0161b90a401a271e41/header.jpg?t=1774410458","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903010/1304252305/dd74da69e34242c5f84e5691c7c7551cca311cf3/1758242383/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758242797","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903010/1304252305/dd74da69e34242c5f84e5691c7c7551cca311cf3/1758242383/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758242797","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903010/1304252305/dd74da69e34242c5f84e5691c7c7551cca311cf3/1758242383/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758242797","id":257184586,"name":"General Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184586/97f828c3bfd44f3b23227f4296ea0bd19ca1f459/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758242797"}],"name":"Cosmic Scramble","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Cosmic Scramble - $2.99 USD","packageid":1371774,"percent_savings":0,"percent_saving